{"title":"Q: &#8220;Want to Feel Old?&#8221; A: &#8220;Yes.&#8221;","link":"https://kottke.org/25/12/q-want-to-feel-old-a-yes","date":1764603723000,"content":"\n        <p>In 2010, Randall Munroe’s fiancée (now wife) was diagnosed with cancer. Every once in awhile, he updates his audience at XKCD on how that’s going. The most recent missive: <a href=\"https://xkcd.com/3172/\">Fifteen Years</a>.</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/xkcd-aurora.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/xkcd-aurora.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/xkcd-aurora.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"628\" alt=\"a panel of an XKCD comic shwing two comic characters looking at an aurora\" /></p>\n\n<p>If you’re not up on XKCD lore, <a href=\"https://www.explainxkcd.com/wiki/index.php/3172:_Fifteen_Years\">here’s an explanation</a>. 💞</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/cancer\">cancer</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/comics\">comics</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Randall%20Munroe\">Randall Munroe</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/XKCD\">XKCD</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/12/q-want-to-feel-old-a-yes\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"055da841ad2c489444c6a5bd9c1ae018a50cdcf7b69c7b5f54bf2a1fed9cdb02","category":"Sites"}